(97022, 2, -141, 0, 16, 'Report to Danitha', 'Speak with Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep.', 'Danitha Morr has ordered you to report back to Bandarion Keep to receive additional training. Please make your way back to the keep as quickly as you are able.', 2, 1.0, 68, 5, 0, 0, 94971, 0, 'EG Link 70862 quest record; Icy Veins confirms giver/ender, level, race and class; Wowhead completion text'),
(94971, 2, -141, 2097152, 16, 'A Paladin''s Steed', 'Speak with Danitha Morr to learn to summon your Warhorse.', 'One of the most important parts of a paladin''s arsenal has always been their warhorse. These specially consecrated animals bear paladins and their arms into battle, and are as fearless and bold as the best of us.$B$BWhile our situation has changed, our need for steeds to bear us into battle has not. It''s time that you had such a mount for yourself.', 2, 1.0, 68, 5, 1279400, 1279399, 0, 0, 'EG Link 70862 quest record; Icy Veins confirms giver/ender, level, race and class; Wowhead completion text');
